CalibBind benchmark data and derived suites
============================================

The benchmark files under `data/` (question sets, product band tables, platform census
snapshot, distillation suites, LFO folds, the E-SWAP counterfactual suite, and derived
lists such as EXCLUDED_PRODUCTS.md) are released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

You are free to share and adapt the data for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit and indicate if changes were made. Suggested citation: the
CalibBind paper (see README.md, Citation section).

Band/product metadata was collected from the public OGE (Open Geo Engine) platform API;
upstream data remains subject to its original terms.
